sequenceDiagram
    participant App
    participant DB as Close()
    participant BF as batchFlusher
    participant F as flusher
    participant C as compactor
    participant W as wal
    participant M as manifest

    App->>DB: Close()
    DB->>DB: closed=true, stop batch timer
    DB->>BF: stop + flush pendingBatch
    loop until active empty and queue drained
        DB->>F: queue active / notifyFlushForce
        DB->>DB: waitForPendingFlushDrain (30s)
    end
    alt drain or worker timeout
        DB-->>App: ErrCloseIncomplete (WAL/manifest left open)
    else success path
        DB->>F: close flushCh, wait flushDone
        DB->>C: close compactCh, wait compactDone
        DB->>DB: discardAllReaders
        DB->>W: Sync + Close
        DB->>M: Close
        DB->>DB: release LOCK
    end
